  "question": {
    "text": "Which of the following thermodynamic relation is correct?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "48hSs",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{dG}=\\mathrm{VdP}-\\mathrm{SdT}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "SSSHh",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{dE}=\\mathrm{PdV}+\\mathrm{TdS}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "vJWJ0",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{dH}=-\\mathrm{VdP}+\\mathrm{TdS}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "YFwJ2",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{dG}=\\mathrm{VdP}+\\mathrm{SdT}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\text { Hints: } \\begin{gathered}\n\\mathrm{dG}=\\mathrm{dH}-\\mathrm{TdS}-\\mathrm{SdT}(\\text { as } \\mathrm{G}=\\mathrm{H}-\\mathrm{TS} \\text { ) } \\\\\n\\text { again, } \\mathrm{H}=\\mathrm{U}+\\mathrm{PV} \\\\\n\\therefore \\mathrm{dH}=\\mathrm{dU}+\\mathrm{PdV}+\\mathrm{VdP} \\\\\n\\& \\mathrm{dU}=\\mathrm{TdS}-\\mathrm{PdV}\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\nThus $d G=(T d S-P d V)+P d V+V d P-T d S-S d T$\n$$\n=\\mathrm{VdP}-\\mathrm{SdT}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
